OL,3,ARussell Brand's wife tells his rape
OL,4,Atrial he is 'kind and a wonderful
OL,5,Afather'
OL,6,
OL,7,FRussell Brand's wife Laura has told a
OL,8,Fcourt her husband is "caring, kind and
OL,9,Fa wonderful father to our children".
OL,11,FThe 39-year-old told the jury at his
OL,12,Frape and sexual assault trial that "the
OL,13,Fway he treats me is to know me",
OL,14,Fadding: "I feel very seen by him... I
OL,15,Flove him very much."
OL,17,FThe media personality faces seven
OL,18,Fcharges - three counts of rape, three
OL,19,Fcounts of sexual assault and one of
OL,20,Fattempted indecent assault. He denies
OL,21,Fall the charges and has pleaded not
OL,22,Fguilty.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
