OL,3,ARussell Brand's wife tells his rape
OL,4,Atrial he is 'kind and a wonderful
OL,5,Afather'
OL,6,
OL,7,FGiving evidence at Southwark Crown
OL,8,FCourt in London on Thursday, Laura
OL,9,FBrand was asked by the defence
OL,10,Fbarrister if her husband respected her
OL,11,Fwhen she didn't want to be sexual with
OL,12,Fhim, and she replied: "Yes absolutely."
